2026-07-10 19:10:50,453 | AGENT | AIInnovation Agent answered: Based on our company context, I propose the following AI components for this project: 

Our Retrieval-augmented generation (RAG) capabilities can be leveraged to improve productivity and quality of work. RAG's core approach allows every answer to be generated from passages retrieved from the client's controlled corpus and cites those passages, rather than relying on a model's parametric memory. This grounding in validated material limits unsupported generation and enhances reliability.

We can fine-tune our models using the client's specific data, but this is optional and would require defining data use terms with the firm and the compliance function beforehand. 

